{"id": null, "n": "0046002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0046002", "type": "orig", "text": "「大」，底本殘，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0046003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0046003", "type": "orig", "text": "「無眾生忍。無眾生忍」，底本作「無々□□□々忍々」，據文意補。從殘剩的筆畫看，第一個殘字應為「眾」。按《金剛經》原文作「無我相，無人相，無眾生相，無壽者相」，故擬補。但尚缺失有關「壽者」的文字。待考。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0046004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0046004", "type": "orig", "text": "「婇」，底本作「采」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0047001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0047001", "type": "orig", "text": "「那含耶」，底本殘，據文意補。按《金剛般若經疏論纂要》稱：「歌利，此云極惡。佛昔作仙山中修道。王獵疲寢，妃共禮仙。王問得四果？皆答不得。王怒割截。」（參見《大正藏》第33卷第163頁上欄）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0047002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0047002", "type": "orig", "text": "「婇」，底本作「采」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0047003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0047003", "type": "orig", "text": "「石。歌」，底本殘，據殘痕及文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0048001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0048001", "type": "orig", "text": "「已」，底本作「以」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0048002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0048002", "type": "orig", "text": "「肢」，底本作「支」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0048003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0048003", "type": "orig", "text": "「耳劓鼻」，底本殘，據殘痕及文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0048004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0048004", "type": "orig", "text": "「已」，底本作「以」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0049001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0049001", "type": "orig", "text": "「嗔恚心」，底本殘，據殘痕及文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0049002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0049002", "type": "orig", "text": "「住色」，底本殘，據殘痕及文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0049003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0049003", "type": "orig", "text": "「惑」，底本作「或」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0049004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0049004", "type": "orig", "text": "「惑」，底本作「或」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0049005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0049005", "type": "orig", "text": "「無住」，按照底本之重文號及倒乙，作「無住無住」。疑衍。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0049006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0049006", "type": "orig", "text": "「想」，底本殘，據殘痕及文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0050001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0050001", "type": "orig", "text": "「相」，底本作「恒」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0050002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0050002", "type": "orig", "text": "「實故」，底本殘，據殘痕及文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0050003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0050003", "type": "orig", "text": "「授」，底本作「受」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0050004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0050004", "type": "orig", "text": "「壽」，底本作「受」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0051001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0051001", "type": "orig", "text": "「增」，底本作「曾」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0052001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0052001", "type": "orig", "text": "「此法」，底本無，據《大正藏》本補。參見《大正藏》第8卷第750頁中欄。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0053001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0053001", "type": "orig", "text": "「法」，底本作「伐」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0053002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0053002", "type": "orig", "text": "「辰」，底本作「晨」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0054001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0054001", "type": "orig", "text": "「議」，底本無，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0055001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0055001", "type": "orig", "text": "「以」，底本無，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0055002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0055002", "type": "orig", "text": "「壽」，底本作「受」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0056001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0056001", "type": "orig", "text": "「惘」，底本作「網」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0057001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0057001", "type": "orig", "text": "「答」，底本無，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0059001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0059001", "type": "orig", "text": "「簡」，底本作「間」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0059002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0059002", "type": "orig", "text": "「惑」，底本作「或」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0060001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0060001", "type": "orig", "text": "「二」，底本正文至此止。後有雜寫四行，不錄文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0021a0201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0021a0201", "type": "add", "text": "但【CB】，伹【藏外】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0037a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0037a0101", "type": "add", "text": "間【CB】，閒【藏外】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0049a1901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0049a1901", "type": "add", "text": "倒【CB】，到【藏外】"}
